---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/PrivateAppLayout.astro';
const sections=[['plan','01','Plan','Prepare the session before the market starts.'],['trade-record','02','Trade Record','Capture broker-derived execution facts and trade context.'],['decision','03','Decision & Execution','Record the thesis, trigger, management and variance.'],['review','04','Review','Review trades, days, weeks and months.'],['development','05','Development','Turn questions into investigations and playbook changes.'],['knowledge','06','Knowledge','Keep lessons, strategy notes, rules and discoveries.']];
---
<BaseLayout title="Trade Avata — Journal">
<div class="journal-shell"><header class="journal-top"><a class="brand" href="/"><img src="/brand/trade-avata-logo.svg" alt=""/><span>TRADE <b>AVATA</b></span></a><nav><a href="/analytics/">Analytics</a><a class="active" href="/journal/">Journal</a></nav></header><main class="journal-main"><div class="eyebrow">TRADE AVATA JOURNAL</div><h1>Plan. Execute. Review.<br/><span>Learn from the record.</span></h1><p class="lead">A focused trading journal connected to the same account identity, without making Journal dependent on Analytics.</p><div class="journal-nav">{sections.map(s=><button data-journal={s[0]}><small>{s[1]}</small><b>{s[2]}</b><span>{s[3]}</span></button>)}</div>
<section class="journal-panel active" data-jpanel="plan"><div class="section-head"><div><span>01 · PLAN</span><h2>Trading Plan</h2><p>Define what you are waiting for before you trade.</p></div><button class="btn primary" id="savePlan">Save plan</button></div><div class="form-grid"><label>Date<input type="date" value="2026-09-28"/></label><label>Session<select><option>London</option><option>New York</option><option>Asia</option></select></label><label>Watchlist<input placeholder="EURUSD, XAUUSD…"/></label><label>HTF bias<select><option>Neutral</option><option>Bullish</option><option>Bearish</option></select></label><label class="wide">Market condition<textarea placeholder="Trend, range, volatility, liquidity…"></textarea></label><label class="wide">Scenarios<textarea placeholder="If X happens, I will look for Y. Invalidation: Z."></textarea></label><label class="wide">What I am waiting for<textarea placeholder="Confirmation, level, trigger, catalyst…"></textarea></label><label class="wide">What I am NOT trading<textarea placeholder="Conditions that invalidate the plan."></textarea></label></div></section>
<section class="journal-panel" data-jpanel="trade-record"><div class="section-head"><div><span>02 · TRADE RECORD</span><h2>Trade Record</h2><p>Broker/platform facts belong here; manual labels should not override source data.</p></div></div><div class="trade-record-card"><div><span>TRADE ID</span><b>TA-DEMO-1024</b></div><div><span>ACCOUNT</span><b>Trade Avata Demo</b></div><div><span>SYMBOL</span><b>EURUSD</b></div><div><span>DIRECTION</span><b>BUY</b></div><div><span>ENTRY</span><b>1.1712</b></div><div><span>EXIT</span><b>1.1744</b></div><div><span>NET P&L</span><b class="positive">+$96.00</b></div><div><span>R</span><b>+1.6R</b></div></div></section>
<section class="journal-panel" data-jpanel="decision"><div class="section-head"><div><span>03 · DECISION & EXECUTION</span><h2>Why did I take it?</h2><p>Good trade ≠ profitable trade. Review setup quality separately from execution quality.</p></div></div><div class="form-grid"><label>Setup<select><option>Breakout</option><option>Pullback</option><option>Trend</option><option>Reversal</option></select></label><label>Confidence<input type="range" min="1" max="10" value="7"/></label><label class="wide">Thesis<textarea placeholder="Why this trade made sense at the time."></textarea></label><label class="wide">Confluences<textarea placeholder="HTF alignment, level, structure, catalyst…"></textarea></label><label class="wide">Execution variance<textarea placeholder="Stops, targets, partials, early exit, hesitation or interference."></textarea></label></div></section>
<section class="journal-panel" data-jpanel="review"><div class="section-head"><div><span>04 · REVIEW</span><h2>Review the outcome</h2><p>Separate market outcome from decision quality and execution quality.</p></div></div><div class="review-grid">{[['Setup Quality','8 / 10'],['Execution Quality','7 / 10'],['Rule Adherence','Yes'],['Result','+$96'],['Lesson','Keep the trigger objective.']].map(x=><article><span>{x[0]}</span><b>{x[1]}</b></article>)}</div></section>
<section class="journal-panel" data-jpanel="development"><div class="section-head"><div><span>05 · DEVELOPMENT</span><h2>Investigations</h2><p>Question → filters → comparison → results → save investigation.</p></div><button class="btn primary">New investigation</button></div><div class="investigation-list"><article><span>OPEN</span><h3>Do losses increase after a winning streak?</h3><p>Compare sequence, session, strategy and sizing.</p></article><article><span>SAVED</span><h3>London breakout expectancy</h3><p>Saved from the strategy review.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="journal-panel" data-jpanel="knowledge"><div class="section-head"><div><span>06 · KNOWLEDGE</span><h2>Knowledge Base</h2><p>Lessons, strategy notes, playbook rules, market observations and discoveries.</p></div><button class="btn primary">New note</button></div><div class="knowledge-grid">{['Playbook rules','Strategy notes','Lessons learned','Mistake library','Market observations','Research'].map(x=><article><span>KNOWLEDGE</span><h3>{x}</h3><p>Keep durable knowledge separate from one-off trade notes.</p></article>)}</div></section>
</main></div>
<script>const bs=[...document.querySelectorAll('[data-journal]')],ps=[...document.querySelectorAll('[data-jpanel]')];function show(id){bs.forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active',b.dataset.journal===id));ps.forEach(p=>p.classList.toggle('active',p.dataset.jpanel===id));history.replaceState(null,'','#'+id)}bs.forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>show(b.dataset.journal)));show(location.hash.slice(1)||'plan');document.querySelector('#savePlan')?.addEventListener('click',e=>{e.currentTarget.textContent='Plan saved locally';setTimeout(()=>e.currentTarget.textContent='Save plan',1400)});</script>
</BaseLayout>
<style is:global>@import '../../styles/analytics-journal.css';</style>
